  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Railroad Crossing Investment Plan, through Texas A&amp;M University</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Railroad Crossing Investment Plan Technical Assistance will support the Mexican Railroad Association in improving the safety at railway crossings throughout Mexico. The project will offer commercial opportunities for a wide range of U.S. equipment and services related to railway crossing signaling and communication equipment and technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
